      "message": "Clarify that WRS interrupt interaction matches WFI\n\nThe Zawrs spec already says that the WRS instructions follow\nWFI's rules for resumption upon interrupts, but the surrounding\nlanguage suggests something different (that they need only be\npending, not locally enabled).  Resolve this contradiction by\nchanging the language to match that of WFI.\n\nNote that implementations that resolve this contradiction in the opposite\ndirection are technically still correct, since it is valid to break out of\nthe WRS stall for any reason.",
